# Written by AgentKit.
#
# config.yaml holds this project's settings and is meant to be committed: it is
# how a team shares one coding level and one set of hook toggles. Everything
# else in this directory is generated by the installer and regenerated on the
# next `ak kit init`, so it does not belong in version control.
#
# Keep credentials out of config.yaml. API keys and passphrases belong in your
# own ~/.agentkit/config.yaml, which stays on your machine.
*
!.gitignore
!config.yaml
